	"bodyHtml": "<div class=\"d--flex\" style=\"flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n                    \n\n                                        \n                            <div id=\"id-34-72\" class=\"section section__textblock section--none section--padding bg-c--hard-conversion txt-c--nero title-c--nero link-c--nero\">\n      <div class=\"san-container\" data-span=\"full-desktop\">\n                    <div class=\"san-col\" data-span=\"12 desktop-xl-6\">\n        <div class=\"j-content txt--left pb--0 desktop-xl-pb--60\" data-block=\"\" data-type=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"text\">\n          <h1>IRRESISTIBLY DELICIOUS PIECES OF FISH OR MEAT IN JELLY OR PATE!</h1>\n\n                </div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n\n  <div class=\"san-col\" data-span=\"12 desktop-xl-6\">\n          <div class=\"j-content txt--left pt--0 desktop-xl-pt--60\" data-block=\"\" data-type=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"text\">\n          <p>گربه شما گوشت‌خوار واقعی است؟ پس خوش‌شانس است! قوطی‌های Voskes با ژله نرم یا پته پر از تکه‌های لطیف ماهی و گوشت، خوراکی رؤیایی هر گربه‌اند.</p>\n\n                </div>\n    </div>\n        </div>\n          </div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-32\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--white title-c--chicken link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-blikjes_gelei_stapel1-images-38-32.png\" alt=\"jelly or paté for cats\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h3>CHOOSE FROM 22 SURPRISING FLAVOUR SENSATIONS!</h3><p>This jelly or paté contains <strong>only natural ingredients</strong>. The fish and meat are carefully <strong>steamed</strong> to preserve all nutrients and aromas even better. Moreover, the fish comes from <strong>sustainable fishing</strong>. There is a choice of <strong>22 unique recipes</strong> based on fish or meat so you have plenty of choice to spoil your furry housemate. What's not to like?</p><h3>HEALTHY SKIN &amp; COAT</h3><p>Our <strong>85 g jelly cans</strong> are rich in <strong>animal proteins and fatty acids</strong>, contributing to <strong>shiny, healthy skin and coat</strong>. They make a great addition to the menu of your four-legged furry friend and- are ideal for fully indulging your cat. In the morning when you get up or in the evening when you come home: our tins of jelly are the absolute highlight of your house tigers' day, so... Enjoy your taste of happiness!</p><a href=\"/cat-food/complementary-wet-food.html\" class=\"btn mt--15 btn--nero btn--normal\">همه طعم‌ها را ببینید</a></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n                    \n\n                                        \n            \n            \n                              \n\n<div id=\"id-38-33\" class=\"highlight section section--none txt-c--nero bg-c--transparent title-c--cat-primary link-c--nero link-hc--nero\">\n    <div class=\"san-container p--0\" data-span=\"full\" data-options=\"\" data-no-gap=\"\"><div class=\"san-col highlight__media highlight__media--half\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-2\"><div class=\"ar-tablet-lg--4by3 ar--4by3 ar\" style=\"height: 100%;\"><div class=\"highlight__single-image ar__content\">\n      <img src=\"/uploads/landscape/landscape-landscape-cat_visual_blogpost_2-images-8-58-images-38-33.png\" alt=\"WHY YOUR CAT IS A FAN OF OUR JELLY AND PATÉ CANS\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"obj--cover\">\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"san-col pv--15 tablet-lg-pv--0\" data-span=\"12 tablet-lg-6\" data-order=\"tablet-lg-1\" data-options=\"extra-padding--tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-container ps--0 mobile-lg-ps--15 tablet-lg-ps--0 h-100\" data-span=\"full-tablet-lg\"><div class=\"san-col tablet-lg-ps--0\"><div class=\"j-content\" data-type=\"container\" data-centered=\"\" data-block=\"\"><div class=\"j-content txt--left\" data-type=\"text\"><h2>REASONS WHY YOUR CAT IS A FAN OF OUR JELLY AND PATÉ CANS:</h2><ul><li><strong>22 exclusive recipes based on fish or meat, something for everyone</strong></li><li><strong>Irresistibly tastyyyyyy</strong></li><li><strong>Cans of 85 g with only natural ingredients</strong></li><li><strong>Steamed and prepared by hand</strong></li><li><strong>Easily digestible</strong></li><li><strong>Ocean-friendly; no fish from overfished areas, no drift nets</strong></li><li><strong>High proportion of essential amino acids</strong></li><li><strong>Rich in animal proteins</strong></li></ul><a href=\"/cat-food/complementary-wet-food.html\" class=\"btn mt--15 btn--nero btn--normal\">همه طعم‌ها را ببینید</a></div></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            </div>"
